  "anatomy-and-physiology-1-va-anatomy-and-physiology-1-syllabus-pdf": {
    "courseTitle": "Anatomy and Physiology 1",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1",
        "title": "This is the last body system that you will explore in this course. Have you decided yet which one",
        "subpoints": [
          {
            "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1-topic-1",
            "title": "you feel is the most important? Which one, if it fails, will impact a person’s life the most? Have"
          },
          {
            "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1-topic-2",
            "title": "you thought about whether breathing is more important than the message the brain sends to the"
          },
          {
            "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1-topic-3",
            "title": "lungs to perform the action of breathing? Is your decision firm? What if you now learn that there"
          },
          {
            "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1-topic-4",
            "title": "are two organ systems that work together more than any others to maintain homeostasis? Would"
          },
          {
            "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1-topic-5",
            "title": "this change your mind? In this unit you are going to learn about the intricate ways that the"
          },
          {
            "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1-topic-6",
            "title": "glands and organs of the endocrine system work with the nervous system to ensure that all the"
          },
          {
            "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1-topic-7",
            "title": "hormone, electrolyte, and fluid levels are kept in balance. After working through this unit, you’ll"
          },
          {
            "id": "this-is-the-last-body-system-that-you-wi-1-topic-8",
            "title": "be asked which is truly your favorite unit and the one that you believe plays the most important"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
